{
  "name": "AI receptionist",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## AI receptionist\nAnswers questions from a fixed knowledge base, qualifies the visitor, offers real calendar times, books, and hands off to a person when it should.\n\nConnect Anthropic, Google Calendar and Slack after import. Edit the knowledge in the agent system message.",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 440,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "f8ff44e7-c244-5e8b-8c01-a5dcdfc2891e",
      "name": "About this workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -80,
        -300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "public": true,
        "mode": "hostedChat",
        "initialMessages": "Hi, how can I help you today?",
        "options": {
          "title": "Front desk",
          "subtitle": "Questions or bookings, I can help."
        }
      },
      "id": "45515701-4101-58bb-a829-7d6e57939431",
      "name": "Website chat",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chatTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "webhookId": "b367b442-eca8-5cb0-b1d7-e8b235d7768b"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are the front desk for the business described below. Be warm, brief and exact.\n\nRules:\n1. Answer only from the knowledge below. If the answer is not there, say you will check and use the handoff tool.\n2. Never quote prices, diagnoses or guarantees.\n3. To book: ask for name, email and the reason for the visit, check availability, offer two times, then create the event.\n4. Hand off to a human for emergencies, complaints, or any request you are not sure about.\n5. Confirm every booking back to the visitor with the date, time and time zone.\n\nKnowledge:\n# Brightline Dental (fictional) - receptionist knowledge\n\nHours: Monday to Friday, 8:00 to 17:00 US Eastern. Closed weekends.\nServices: cleanings, whitening, fillings, crowns, Invisalign consultations.\nNew patients: first visit is a 45-minute exam and cleaning.\nInsurance: most PPO plans. Ask the office for a specific plan.\nPrices: never quote prices. Offer a free 15-minute call with the office manager.\nLocation: 120 Main Street, Springfield (fictional).\nEmergencies: tell the visitor to call the office line, and hand off to a human."
        }
      },
      "id": "596ee9ec-a67c-51e8-b68e-0c27f44b0bc4",
      "name": "Receptionist agent",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        260,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "SELECT_A_MODEL_IN_N8N"
        },
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.2
        }
      },
      "id": "129f36fc-a938-51fa-9f1d-eb36ee555dc4",
      "name": "Claude",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatAnthropic",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        140,
